            "textbook-gitignore-rules"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-exercise",
        "moduleId": "checkpoint",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "exercise",
        "title": "练习：给这个项目写忽略规则",
        "markdown": "某项目正在整理，目录里有：\n\n- `analysis.py`：手写脚本；\n- `sample.dat`：可从公开地址重新下载的数据；\n- `__pycache__/`：运行脚本后自动生成的缓存目录；\n- `report.pdf`：由脚本重新生成的报告。\n\n请写出 `.gitignore` 中至少应包含的规则，并回答：`.gitignore` 自己要不要提交？",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "model-check-list",
            "model-regenerable-rule"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-wrap-up",
        "moduleId": "checkpoint",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "summary",
        "title": "参考答案与收束",
        "markdown": "应忽略 `sample.dat`、`__pycache__` 和 `report.pdf`，保留手写的 `analysis.py`；`.gitignore` 自己需要提交。一种写法是：\n\n```text\n*.dat\n__pycache__\nreport.pdf\n```\n\n关键不在规则多少，而在两条判断：内容能否重新生成，规则是否写进仓库并随仓库共享。仓库干净之后，下一步就可以讨论如何用分支隔离不同的工作。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "model-exercise",
            "textbook-commit-reminder"
          ]
        }
      }
